      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Rafael%2C_California",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1855, Vincent's, an Italian Renaissance Mission-style church, was built and later became a California historical landmark.",
